# Environment Variables

## Mapbox Token (Required for Map Visualization)

To use the map visualization feature, you need a Mapbox access token.

### How to get a token:

1. Go to https://account.mapbox.com/
2. Create an account or sign in
3. Navigate to "Tokens" section
4. Create a new Public token or use the Default public token
5. Copy the token

### Add to your .env.local file:

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=your_mapbox_token_here
```

### Important Notes:

- The free tier includes 50,000 map loads per month
- The token is used client-side (hence NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix)
- Without this token, the map will show an error message instead of the map

### Pricing:

- Free: Up to 50,000 map loads/month
- Beyond that: $5 per 1,000 additional map loads
- See https://www.mapbox.com/pricing for details
